## Settings catalog (src/diff/settingsCatalog.ts)

The names, settings-page locations, types, limits and choices of Snapmaker
Orca's settings, used to label and group settings in comparisons, presets and
"What changed?". They are generated from Snapmaker Orca's source
(github.com/Snapmaker/OrcaSlicer: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp,
src/libslic3r/Preset.cpp and src/slic3r/GUI/Tab.cpp), at the release named at
the top of the generated file. Snapmaker Orca is AGPL-3.0-or-later.

Besides facts about each setting (its key, value type, limits, choices and the
preset it belongs to), the catalog includes Snapmaker Orca's short label for
each setting and the names of its settings pages and sections, in the order
Snapmaker Orca shows them. They are there so that any2orca names each setting
the way Snapmaker Orca does. The catalog includes no tooltips or other help
text, and none of Snapmaker Orca's code.

## Filament color data (src/archive/filamentColorNames.ts)

Filament color names used for display were compiled from Bambu Lab's and
Polymaker's own published documentation and product pages (filament names and
hex color codes), not copied from any single vendor's software.

